```

注意"混入终态成员、成员已属另一组或事件非COMMANDING则422"——这三类都是 422 illegalTransition。任务不存在 → 404。数量 → 400。

chooseBranch 逻辑：
```java
String commandKey = requireText(req.commandKey(), "commandKey");
String taskKey = requireText(req.taskKey(), "taskKey");
if (req.expectedGroupVersion() == null) throw badRequest("expectedGroupVersion 不能为空");
long expected = req.expectedGroupVersion();
Incident incident = lockIncident(incidentKey);
requireCommander(incident, actor); // 权限先于重放
return runIdempotent(commandKey, "branch_group_choose",
    hash(incidentKey, actor, groupKey, taskKey, Long.toString(expected)),
    BranchGroupView.class, () -> {
        IncidentTaskBranchGroup group = groups.findByKey(incident.id(), groupKey).orElseThrow(() -> notFound("分支组不存在: " + groupKey));
        // 成员校验：taskKey 必须属于该组
        List<IncidentTask> members = listMembers(group.id());
        IncidentTask chosen = members.stream().filter(t -> t.taskKey().equals(taskKey)).findFirst()
            .orElseThrow(() -> notFound("任务不属于该分支组: " + taskKey));
```

"未知成员404"——成员不属于组或不存在都 404。如果 taskKey 在事件里存在但不属于组？也是"未知成员"（对该组而言）→ 404。

```java
        if (group.status() == CHOSEN) throw conflict("分支组已选择，不能再次选择或变更");
        if (group.version() != expected) throw conflict("组版本不匹配: 当前 " + group.version() + "，期望 " + expected);
        List<String> unresolved = unresolvedBlockers(chosen.id());
        if (!unresolved.isEmpty()) throw conflict("选中成员存在未解除阻塞的事件: ...", List.copyOf(unresolved));
        Instant now = now();
        int updated = groups.markChosen(group.id(), expected, chosen.id(), actor, now);
        if (updated == 0) throw conflict("分支组已被并发选择");
        tasks.markDone(chosen.id(), actor, now);
        for (member : members) if (member.id() != chosen.id()) tasks.markCancelled(member.id(), actor, now);
        return toBranchGroupView(groups.findByKey(incident.id(), groupKey).orElseThrow());
    });
```

